%% DM26-0670

%% How a signed policy reaches every agent and how it is enforced. Built: steps 1 to 12 (2026-10-13, authority-distribution.md).
%% Designed, not built (policy-enforcement.md, decisions of 2026-10-21): the broker as a holder (stage 5), aging, the bounded
%% degraded window and the restart into init (stage 6).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant Sign as polar-sign
    participant GS as polar-git-server<br/>(polar-schedules)
    participant Sch as scheduler<br/>observer and processor
    participant CA as credentials agent<br/>consumer
    participant Bk as Cassini broker
    participant Ag as every builder agent<br/>(AuthorityActor, PolicyActor)

    Admin->>Sign: polar-sign runtime --agent credentials-agent --section policy --version N
    Note over Sign: designed: the Cedar text is validated against the schema before signing
    Sign-->>Admin: the signed document (c:update-policy)
    Admin->>GS: push permanent/... over mTLS
    GS->>Sch: RepoChanged
    Sch->>CA: agent.credentials-agent.configuration (forwarded unverified, the receiver verifies)
    CA->>CA: verify chain, signer's c:update-policy (capability only, Cedar never governs its own authorship),<br/>revocation, version higher, then the schema (designed)
    CA->>CA: re-sign as an authority Update with the escrow key, apply locally
    CA->>Bk: publish polar-authority-updates
    Bk->>Ag: deliver
    Ag->>Ag: AuthorityCore: published_by is the credentials agent, key pinned from the first snapshot,<br/>signature, sequence: SetPolicy to the PolicyActor (a set that does not parse leaves the old one)

    rect rgb(235, 219, 178)
    Note over Bk: DESIGNED: the broker holds an authority too, fed in process from its own Listener
    Bk->>Bk: the same AuthorityCore, for its subscribe and publish decisions
    end

    loop every 30 minutes, the heartbeat
        CA->>Bk: snapshot republished
        Bk->>Ag: deliver, the clock restarts (designed)
    end

    Note over Ag: a decision: Cedar first, the certificate where no policy speaks (both directions)

    rect rgb(235, 219, 178)
    Note over CA,Ag: DESIGNED: the credentials agent is unreachable
    Ag->>Ag: 45 minutes without hearing: ask for a snapshot
    Ag->>Ag: degraded: keep deciding with the cached policy, the certificate where it is silent
    Ag->>Ag: 90 minutes (POLAR_AUTHORITY_MAX_AGE_SECS): fail the health check
    Note over Ag: the shutdown pipeline, exit 1, the Job's new pod waits in init<br/>for the credentials agent (health_rejuvenation)
    end
